  "skill_summaries": {
    "ultimate": "flash to an enemy and deal multiple attacks",
    "skill1": "pounce on weakest nearby enemy, dealing damage",
    "skill2": "gain stat bonuses when an enemy HP is low",
    "skill3": "battle ATK increase",
    "skill4": "reset pounce cooldown and recover energy on each non-summoned enemy defeat",
    "skill5": "pounce reduces extra Phys DEF when carrying specific buff"
  },
  "play_overview": "[[Seth]] flashes to a foe for **multi-hit ultimate damage**, then pounces on the **weakest nearby enemy** for repeated assassin pressure between casts. Low enemy HP **grants stat bonuses**, battle ATK rises, and each non-summon defeat **resets pounce cooldown and refunds energy** to chain kills across the fight. Pounce also **shreds extra Phys DEF** when he carries a specific buff, opening tankier targets for follow-up from allies. He chains **assassin resets** in fights with frequent kills and accessible weak marks on the board. Without **finishes or accessible weak targets**, his pounce loop and stat spikes stall out before he can snowball through the enemy line in longer fights.",
  "counter_overview": "[[Seth]] **flashes and pounces** onto weak marks, then **resets on kills** to chain across your line. His ultimate is **invincible during the cast**, and single-target assassins **struggle to pin** him as he relocates. Answer with lasting wide ultimates like [[Shemira]] or [[Frieren]], keep your weakest target **above easy pounce range**, and deny kill chains by bursting him between pounces when he is exposed."
}
